      .regular at launch only when the persisted "显示 Dock 图标" setting is on.
      Keeping LSUIElement here prevents AppKit/LaunchServices from resetting a
      menu-bar-only app back to .regular when it is activated via the menu bar.
    -->
    <key>LSUIElement</key>
    <true/>
    <key>LSMultipleInstancesProhibited</key>
    <true/>
    <key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
    <true/>
